Package: mcp-terminal-docker
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Vasiliy Zdanovskiy <vasilyvz@gmail.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: docker.io | docker-ce, adduser, python3, curl, ca-certificates, openssl
Suggests: man-db, install-info, texinfo
Description: MCP Terminal service (Docker image + host integration)
 Installs systemd unit, host directories, pulls the matching Docker Hub service
 image and sandbox worker images on install/upgrade. Config: /etc/mcp-terminal/,
 logs: /var/log/mcp-terminal/, data: /var/mcp-terminal/. Run "mcp-terminal-info".
